{"translation":{"id":"gaz_ebi","name":"ክታበ ቁልቁሉ, Biblica® ሂካ አመያ በነማ ሃራ, ሎቆደ ዽኣ","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=gaze","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=gaze","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"EBI","englishName":"West Central Oromo Bible","language":"gaz","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"f3eeb22163e62abd4aeeda7f1c58a68dfa1fff2482db437ee160fb95280d59e5","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/gaz_ebi/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31102,"languageName":"Oromoo","languageEnglishName":"Oromo"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"gaz_ebi","name":"እሳያስ","commonName":"እሳያስ","title":"ራጂ እሳያስ","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"facb2a44ef285c458e78c3b7f4f0eb40f3e78a02fd919a9bd75ad65e4f107304","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/gaz_ebi/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/gaz_ebi/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1292},"chapter":{"number":35,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["ገመቹ ወረ ፉረመኒ"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"ገሞጂፊ ለፍት ጎጋን ንገመዱ፤","poem":1},{"text":"ለፍት ኦናን ንእልልቸ፤ ንደራረስ።","poem":2},{"text":"አከ አርፋሴ፣","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"ባይእናን ደራረ፤","poem":1},{"text":"አከ መሌ ገመዴስ እልልቸ።","poem":2},{"text":"ኡልፍን ልባኖን፣ ሱራን ቀርሜሎሲፊ","poem":1},{"text":"ሻሮን ንኬነማፍ፤","poem":2},{"text":"እሳን ኡልፍነ ዋቀዮ፣","poem":1},{"text":"ሱራ ዋቀኬኛስ ንአርጉ።","poem":2}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"text":"ሀርከ ደዸቤ ጀጀቤሳ፤","poem":1},{"text":"ጅልበ ላፌስ ጭምሳ፤","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"ወረ ገራንሳኒ ሶዳቱን አከነ ጄዻ፦","poem":1},{"text":"“ጀባዻ፤ ህንሶዳትና፤","poem":2},{"text":"ዋቅንኬሰን ንዹፈ፤","poem":1},{"text":"እን ሃሎ ባሱፍ ዹፈ፤","poem":2},{"text":"ገቲ መሉ ቀበቴ","poem":1},{"text":"እስን ኦልቹፍ ንዹፈ።”","poem":2}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"ኤርገሲ እጅ ነመ ጃማ ንበነመ፤","poem":1},{"text":"ጉር ነመ ዱዳስ ንዸገአ።","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"ጋፈስ ነምን ናፍት አኩመ ገደምሳ ኡታለ፤","poem":1},{"text":"አረብን ህዸማንስ ገመቹዻን ፋርፈተ።","poem":2},{"text":"ብሻን ገሞጂ ኬሳ፣","poem":1},{"text":"ቡርቃንስ ገሞጂ ኬሳ ጨብሴ በአ።","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"ለፍት ነመ ጉቡ ሀሮ፣","poem":1},{"text":"ለፍት ጎጋንሞ ቡርቃ ብሻኒ ተአ።","poem":2},{"text":"ቦለ ዱራን ዋንጎትን ኬሰ ጪሰንረት መርገ፣","poem":1},{"text":"ሸምበቆፊ ዸላዱቱ ብቅለ።","poem":2}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"ከራን ጉዳን ቶኮ አች ንጅራተ፤","poem":1},{"text":"እንስ፣ ከራ ቁልቁልና ጄዸሜ ዋመመ፤","poem":2},{"text":"እን ወረ ከራ ሰነረ ዴመኒፍ ተአ።","poem":1},{"text":"“ጡራኦን” እሰረ ህንዴመን፤","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ጎዎትን አቺኑ ህንበአን።","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"ሌንጭ አችት ህንአርገሙ፤","poem":1},{"text":"ዮካን ብኔንስ ሀማን አችረ ህንበኡ፤","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"እሳን አችት ህንአርገመን።","poem":2},{"text":"ገሩ ወረ ፉረመን ቆፈቱ አችረ ዴመ፤","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"ወር ዋቀዮ እሳን ፉሬ ንዴብኡ።","poem":2},{"text":"እሳን ፋርፈናዻን ጥዮን ሴኑ፤","poem":1},{"text":"ገመቹን በረ በራ መታሳኒረ ጅራተ።","poem":2},{"text":"እሳን ገመቹፊ እልሌዻን ጉተሙ፤","poem":1},{"text":"ገዲፊ ቦእች እሳንራ ፈጋቱ።","poem":2}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/gaz_ebi/ISA/35.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/gaz_ebi/ISA/36.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/gaz_ebi/ISA/34.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":10}